{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415732","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415732","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1041573201:1":{"text":"여기 좋네. 물론 숨 막히는 도서관이랑 비교하면 어디든 다 좋지만...","source_cn":"这地方可真不错，当然了，跟死气沉沉的图书馆相比，哪里都好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E18EB893F5346DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041573202:1":{"text":"...음? 묘한 냄새네. 드래곤의 알 에센스의 비릿한 단내에... 땅거미 숲의 기운이 미약하게 느껴져.","source_cn":"……嗯？稀奇的味道。龙蛋液的腥甜底下，掺着一缕……薄暮...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0725F5F5DB5B1302","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041573203:1":{"text":"세... 셀로클랜드?!","source_cn":"唔……萨……萨洛克兰？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF21DAA9C7404DC81","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041573204:1":{"text":"분명해!「에스페리아 견문 기록 전집」에서 봤어. 너... 그 신비로운 지하 왕국에서 왔구나?!","source_cn":"没错，检索了《伊索米亚见闻记录大全》，你来自那座神秘的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0CC6ADDF8E735B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041573205:1":{"text":"지나친 예리함은 쓸데없는 위험을 불러오기도 합니다.","source_cn":"过人的敏锐，同时也是多余的危险。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE6A572EFEA0A025","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041573206:1":{"text":"긴장 풀어, 꼬맹아. 난 답답한 지하는 질색이거든. 도서관에만 박혀 있는 것도 답답해 죽겠구만...","source_cn":"别紧张呀小家伙。莱希拉姆的校规只管书架间不准喧哗，可管...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE92A3778CF1F432","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041573207:1":{"text":"난 그냥 천 년 넘게 산 여왕은 드래곤 알을 먹을 때 소금파인지 설탕파인지가 궁금할 뿐이라고. 아, 그건 계란이 아니라 감자였나?","source_cn":"我只是好奇，那位活了上千岁的女王，享用龙蛋液时，是喜欢...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3BF950E901ACF929","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041573208:1":{"text":"언행에 주의하십시오.","source_cn":"你应当注意言辞。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8D9C3CA5750D14F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041573209:1":{"text":"과도한 호기심은 화를 불러오기 마련입니다.","source_cn":"好奇心过盛毫无益处。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAFA53AB39FC5C6E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041573210:1":{"text":"어휴, 딱딱하긴... 알겠어. 나도 성의를 보여야 하니까 엄청 중요한 아카데미의 비밀을 알려줄게.","source_cn":"好吧好吧，为表诚意，我用一条重量级的校规秘密和你交换。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98CD9CFF93532060","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041573211:1":{"text":"예를 들어서... 교칙 제 41조 제2항, 연금술 수업 중 재채기 금지!","source_cn":"比如……校规第四十一条第二款，炼金课禁止打喷嚏！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2A43B0FCC61C90A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041573212:1":{"text":"왜 이런 규칙이 생겼는지 궁금하지? 내 질문에 대답해 주면 알려줄게. 어때? 꽤 괜찮은 거래잖아!","source_cn":"想知道原因吗？跟我说说就告诉你，这笔买卖怎么样，很划算吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE318B6F1E4CC838","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041573213:1":{"text":"여왕님의 은총은 저에게 목숨을 주셨습니다. 제겐 그분의 취향을 논할 권리는 없습니다.","source_cn":"女王的恩典赋予我生命，而非谈论她喜好的权利。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE524544319C20A4C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041573214:1":{"text":"망언은 그쯤 하십시오, 악마.","source_cn":"妄言适可而止，恶魔。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCCE6229191FD0EA0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041573215:1":{"text":"아이 참, 화내지 말라니까~ 그럼 별로 중요하지 않을 것 같은 질문으로 바꿀게.","source_cn":"哎呀，别生气嘛，那换一点无关紧要的问题好了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7644E932AB39DAC0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1041573216:1":{"text":"너희 셀로클랜드 사람들은 오래 산다며? 그럼 몇 살에 정년 퇴임이야?","source_cn":"既然你们萨洛克兰人的寿命那么长，那一般多少岁退休呀？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4014997D673A709A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1041573217:1":{"text":"아, 그리고 일주일에 얼마나 쉬어? 하루? 이틀?","source_cn":"一周是双休还是三休？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x208B50C330A7C976","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1041573218:1":{"text":"...기밀입니다.","source_cn":"……无可奉告","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE809AC8471950A3E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1041573219:1":{"text":"뭐야! 설마 3일이나 쉬는 건 아니지?!","source_cn":"唉，无趣！还不如回去找几个新生捉弄一下呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D02E1ED1A811228","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1041573220:1":{"text":"젠장! 3일이라... 하지만 답답한 지하는 질색인데...","source_cn":"至少比跟一块会走路的硬石头聊天有意思。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2DBBD7CD7502C083","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:康缇丝":{"text":"칸티아스","source":"康缇丝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:都铎":{"text":"튜더","source":"都铎","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":21,"localized_text_count":20,"speaker_count":2}}